        reach me is email.
      </p>
      <div class="dev__contact-links">
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`} class="dev__btn dev__btn--primary">{CONTACT.email}</a>
        <a href={CONTACT.github} class="dev__btn dev__btn--secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          GitHub
